{"id":"rede","lemma":"rede","pos":"noun","rank":1330,"glosses":["net (mesh behind the goal frame)","hairnet (netting worn over one's hair)","sieve (something that catches and filters everything)"],"ipa":"/ˈʁe.d͡ʒi/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"redes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-rede.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom dormiu em uma rede.","en":"Tom slept in a hammock.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Eu peguei borboletas com uma rede.","en":"I captured butterflies with a net.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to grab, hold","l":"pegar"},{"g":"butterfly, moth","l":"borboleta"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Tom balançou as redes.","en":"Tom scored a goal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537276","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to swing","l":"balançar"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Você tem conta em alguma rede social?","en":"Do you have any social media accounts?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"operation, calculation"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"some, any","l":"algum"},null,{"g":"social"}]},{"text":"Ele consertou a rede.","en":"He fixed the net.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to fix, to repair","l":"consertar"},{"g":"the / to"},null]}]}